                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " package contains classes that represent RDBMS queries, updates, and stored procedures as thread-safe, reusable objects. See "
              },
              {
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "Modeling JDBC Operations as Java Objects"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "xref",
                "target": "data-access/jdbc/object.html"
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": ". This style results in a more object-oriented approach, although objects returned by queries are naturally disconnected from the database. This higher-level of JDBC abstraction depends on the lower-level abstraction in the "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "org.springframework.jdbc.core"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " package."
              }
